+                // terminal block rendering; hidden Agent blocks can then report exit code 0 with
+                // empty output. The session executor selects RemoteServerCommandExecutor when the
+                // Warp remote server is available and RemoteCommandExecutor (SSH ControlMaster)
+                // otherwise. Keep long-running/interactive commands on the PTY so the Agent can
